Aim: Demonstrate an array with a loop and conditional statement.

Algorithm: Start
create array
loop through elements check even/odd
print
stop.

Program:

class ArrayControl {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        int[] a = {2, 5, 8, 11};
        for (int n : a) {
            if (n % 2 == 0) System.out.println(n + " is even");
            else System.out.println(n + " is odd");
        }
    }
}

Result: 2 and 8 are even; 5 and 11 are odd.
